{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"5606ff53dbf6d121dcf5f38beb3bd015c6c14b0f2915d7372d34815a7afdda23","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["責備以色列人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽耶和華責備你們的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"責備我從埃及領出來的整個民族的話，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『世上萬族之中，我只揀選了你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要因你們的罪惡而懲罰你們。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"若非相約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二人怎會同行呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若非捕到獵物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獅子怎會在林中咆哮呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若非獵獲食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猛獅怎會在洞中吼叫呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若非設下誘餌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鳥兒怎會落入圈套？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若非捕獲什麼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"圈套怎會收起來？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若城中響起號角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"居民豈不恐懼顫抖？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若災禍降臨城中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不是耶和華的作為？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"的確，主耶和華不向祂的僕人——眾先知顯明祂的計劃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就不會採取任何行動。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獅子吼叫，誰不懼怕呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華已發言，誰能不傳講呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要向亞實突和埃及的城堡宣告：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們要聚集到撒瑪利亞的山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看城中的混亂和暴虐之事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不知正道，強取豪奪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把擄物囤積在他們的城堡中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「敵人要圍攻此地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻破你們的防守，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搶掠你們的城堡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「牧人從獅口中救羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只能奪回兩條腿和一塊耳朵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同樣，住在撒瑪利亞的以色列人被救回的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也僅剩一角床榻和一片臥椅。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主——萬軍之上帝耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們要聽這話，去警告雅各家。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我追討以色列人的罪時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要摧毀伯特利的祭壇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將祭壇的角砍落在地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要拆毀過冬和避暑的房屋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"破壞象牙裝飾的宮殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"推倒許多宏偉的樓宇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}